content.text:
The root cause of the "wonky" selection behavior lies in the `toggleSelection` function in `renamer-browser/static/js/app.js`.

**Root Cause:**
In single-select mode (default), the function clears all selections *before* checking if the current item is selected.
```javascript
if (!state.multiSelect) {
    state.selected.clear(); // 1. Selection cleared (Set is empty)
}
if (state.selected.has(path)) { // 2. Always returns false!
    state.selected.delete(path);
} else {
    state.selected.add(path); // 3. Always adds the item back
}
```
This means:
1.  **You cannot deselect an item:** Clicking a selected item clears it and immediately re-selects it.
